From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 11:51:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Cam only for phase sync at start (pro-style)

New bit camSyncOnlyAtStart (replaces unusedBit_Fancy25, off by default). Once the
engine runs with phase sync, cam teeth no longer change the engine phase, so a bad cam
signal while running cannot shift injection and spark; VVT position still works.
The decision, together with maxCamPhaseResolveRpm, is in shouldUseCamForPhase().

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkhsyMr5ndz2MBCxuDZhPC
